      "turn_id": "t0",
      "index": 0,
      "participant_id": "p.jordan",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:00:05Z",
      "text": "Hello, I'm Jordan, one of the NP students. So you're here about your diabetes?"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t1",
      "index": 1,
      "participant_id": "p.patient",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:00:25Z",
      "text": "I guess so. I'm thirsty all the time and I'm up all night going to the bathroom.",
      "avatar": {
        "emotion": "anxious",
        "intensity": 0.5
      }
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t2",
      "index": 2,
      "participant_id": "p.jordan",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:00:45Z",
      "text": "How long?"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t3",
      "index": 3,
      "participant_id": "p.patient",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:01:05Z",
      "text": "About three months.",
      "avatar": {
        "emotion": "anxious",
        "intensity": 0.5
      }
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t4",
      "index": 4,
      "participant_id": "p.jordan",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:01:25Z",
      "text": "Any family history of diabetes?"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t5",
      "index": 5,
      "participant_id": "p.patient",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:01:45Z",
      "text": "My mother had it. She was on dialysis before she died.",
      "avatar": {
        "emotion": "sad",
        "intensity": 0.7,
        "gestures": [
          "looks down"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t6",
      "index": 6,
      "participant_id": "p.jordan",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:02:05Z",
      "text": "Okay. And you're on metformin, 500 twice a day. Are you taking it?"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t7",
      "index": 7,
      "participant_id": "p.patient",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:02:25Z",
      "text": "Yes. I take my metformin every day.",
      "avatar": {
        "emotion": "embarrassed",
        "intensity": 0.6,
        "gestures": [
          "looks away"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t8",
      "index": 8,
      "participant_id": "p.jordan",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:02:45Z",
      "text": "Let me check the pharmacy record."
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t9",
      "index": 9,
      "participant_id": "p.patient",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:03:05Z",
      "text": "All right.",
      "avatar": {
        "emotion": "anxious",
        "intensity": 0.6
      }
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t10",
      "index": 10,
      "participant_id": "p.jordan",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:03:25Z",
      "text": "This says you've only filled it twice in six months. So you haven't been taking it every day. Why did you tell me you were?"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t11",
      "index": 11,
      "participant_id": "p.patient",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:03:45Z",
      "text": "I take it. Maybe the pharmacy has it wrong.",
      "avatar": {
        "emotion": "frustrated",
        "intensity": 0.7,
        "gestures": [
          "crosses arms"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t12",
      "index": 12,
      "participant_id": "p.jordan",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:04:05Z",
      "text": "The record is pretty clear. You need to take it as prescribed or your sugar won't come down."
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t13",
      "index": 13,
      "participant_id": "p.patient",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:04:25Z",
      "text": "I said I take it.",
      "avatar": {
        "emotion": "angry",
        "intensity": 0.6,
        "gestures": [
          "crosses arms"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t14",
      "index": 14,
      "participant_id": "p.jordan",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:04:45Z",
      "text": "Okay. I'm ordering an HbA1c."
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t15",
      "index": 15,
      "participant_id": "p.patient",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:05:05Z",
      "text": "Fine.",
      "avatar": {
        "emotion": "frustrated",
        "intensity": 0.6
      }
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t16",
      "index": 16,
      "participant_id": "p.jordan",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:05:25Z",
      "text": "It's 9.2 percent. That's well above target, which is what I'd expect if doses are being missed. Do you drink a lot of sugary drinks?"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t17",
      "index": 17,
      "participant_id": "p.patient",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:05:45Z",
      "text": "Not really.",
      "avatar": {
        "emotion": "frustrated",
        "intensity": 0.5,
        "gestures": [
          "looks away"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t18",
      "index": 18,
      "participant_id": "p.jordan",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:06:05Z",
      "text": "All right. I'll let my preceptor know about the refills and the A1c, and we'll have you come back in a month. Please try to take the metformin twice a day. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "t19",
      "index": 19,
      "participant_id": "p.patient",
      "at": "2026-10-09T16:06:25Z",
      "text": "No.",
